  H --> J["Count later documents in summary"]
  I --> K["Group recorded roles and save CSV"]
  J --> K
  K --> L{"Saved CSV matches generated output?"}
  L -- No --> D
  L -- Yes --> M["Save monthly summary with provenance"]
  M --> N["Human: check freshness, source evidence and relevant rows"]
  N --> O["Human: confirm responsibility and agree next action"]
  O --> P["Record agreed follow-up in Review Queue"]
  P --> Q["Use draft package and human approval route when needed"]
